OL,3,AGermany's far-right AfD set for big win
OL,4,Ain eastern state, just short of
OL,5,Amajority
OL,6,
OL,7,FGermany's Alternative for Germany (AfD)
OL,8,Fis heading for a big victory in the
OL,9,Feastern state of Saxony-Anhalt, far
OL,10,Fahead of its mainstream rivals,
OL,11,Faccording to incomplete results.
OL,12,FProjections indicate it is set to fall
OL,13,Fshort of a majority, but the AfD says
OL,14,Fit has won a mandate to govern.
OL,16,FThe far-right AfD is set to win a
OL,17,Frecord 44% of the vote, well ahead of
OL,18,Fthe conservative CDU on just over 17%.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,0,100
