OL,3,AGermany's far-right AfD set for big win
OL,4,Ain eastern state, just short of
OL,5,Amajority
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe AfD's charismatic leader in the
OL,8,Fstate, Ulrich Siegmund, said it was
OL,9,F"sensational" and they wanted to start
OL,10,Fgoverning as soon as possible.
OL,12,FNo far-right party has won control of a
OL,13,FGerman state since World War Two, and
OL,14,Fgoverning at state level would mean
OL,15,Fpowers over policing, local education
OL,16,Fand culture.
